{"hw":"προσδοκέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">προσδοκέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προσδοκ-έω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-έδοξα</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be thought besides</b>, c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἀπειρόκαλος προσέδοξεν εἶναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.75</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.183</span> </span> (but better divisim <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς ἔδοξεν</span>).</div></div>"}